    {
      "id": "2026-10-stable-agent",
      "severity": "routine",
      "action": "notice",
      "text": "Your node is now kept current from a manifest signed by Team Flowsta. Nothing changes in what it stores; conductor updates now happen in your maintenance window with verification and rollback."
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-10-25-0-7-generation",
      "severity": "routine",
      "action": "notice",
      "text": "Your node now runs a second conductor on Holochain 0.7.1 beside the 0.6.1 one, carrying identity 1.5 and signing 1.5 on the new networks. The first install compiles their wasm, minutes on a small box; nothing changes in what the 0.6 conductor stores."
    },
    {
      "id": "agent-2-0-10-gossip-cap",
      "severity": "routine",
      "action": "notice",
      "text": "Agent 2.0.10: the Holochain 0.7 conductor's config now caps each gossip exchange at 1 MiB, so two peers with a large difference still converge. The 0.7 conductor restarts once in your maintenance window to take it; nothing changes in what it stores."
    },
    {
      "id": "agent-2-0-11",
      "severity": "routine",
      "action": "notice",
      "text": "Agent 2.0.11: a 0.7 conductor holding more than 45 % of the VM's memory is restarted cleanly in the node's slot, at most once a day; each report carries the host's memory, swap, disk and kernel and the conductor's own memory, restarts and refused registrations; old images of our repositories are removed once a day."
    },
    {
      "id": "agent-2-0-12",
      "severity": "routine",
      "action": "notice",
      "text": "Agent 2.0.12: a node whose manifest has a carrier block runs the ProofPoll carrier on a schedule (no other node runs it); a conductor's memory share counts its swap; an app installed under an older app id counts as installed; the status port waits for a hand-over to finish."
    },
    {
      "id": "agent-2-0-13-conductor-flowsta-4",
      "severity": "routine",
      "action": "notice",
      "generation": "holochain-0.7",
      "text": "Agent 2.0.13 and a new 0.7 conductor image: Holochain 0.7.1 as built by WeAreFlowsta/holochain-build (flowsta.4, six patches; nothing another conductor can see changes). It answers a gossip offer of any size, so its config no longer caps an exchange at 1 MiB and long histories reach other conductors. The conductor restarts once in the node's window."
    }
  ],
